OL,3,AUK diesel price hits #2 a litre as US
OL,4,Acalls for EU to release more stocks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe average price of diesel has risen
OL,7,Fabove #2 a litre in the UK for the
OL,8,Ffirst time, according to the RAC
OL,9,Fmotoring body, as the fallout from the
OL,10,FIran war continues to push up the cost
OL,11,Fof fuel.
OL,13,FDiesel has now hit an average of
OL,14,F200.01p a litre, the RAC said, and
OL,15,Fpetrol prices are also still rising,
OL,16,Freaching 174.71p a litre on average.
OL,18,FThe motoring group said price rises
OL,19,Fwere "showing no signs of slowing,
OL,20,Fheaping more misery onto motorists".
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
