OL,3,AUK diesel price hits #2 a litre as US
OL,4,Acalls for EU to release more stocks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US has put increasing pressure on
OL,7,FEuropean countries to release more
OL,8,Fdiesel stocks, to help lower diesel
OL,9,Fprices worldwide, with President Trump
OL,10,Fthreatening to ban US exports of the
OL,11,Ffuel.
